            declarationMechanism: 'Results are determined by immediate card values; no hidden tokens are required.',
            fishingConfig: 'Blackjack is a banking game and does not use a capture-from-tableau fishing mechanic.',
            meldConfig: 'Points are earned only through cumulative hand total; no melding of card sets occurs.',
            shedding: 'Goal is to reach 21 or beat the dealer; hands are resolved by comparison, not by emptying the hand as in shedding games.',
